{
  "info": {
    "name": "E-Commerce - Cart Service",
    "description": "Run top to bottom with the Collection Runner (right-click → Run collection): the 'Wait for ...' requests retry until a Kafka event has arrived, which only works in the Runner. Goes through the api-gateway on 8080, so start Redis, Kafka, user-service, product-service, inventory-service, cart-service and api-gateway first. Every run uses a new customer and a unique tag, so it can be re-run any time. adminEmail/adminPassword must match ADMIN_EMAIL/ADMIN_PASSWORD in .env.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
